{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0392_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0392_1000_p", "source_sha256": "8d14c3682995d1fd9a341691a0507072466242c6cba6043c5e7c9a8ae07c3b30", "ja": "（お茶を淹れようと給湯室に向かう途中、\nなにやら甘い匂いが漂ってきた）", "zh": "（正要去茶水间泡茶的路上，\n不知从哪里飘来了一阵甜甜的香味。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0392_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0392_1001_p", "source_sha256": "90b2fb7a64a6451210d941837e08b9f0c69454d5e8c9c628801f647be5910819", "ja": "くんくん、なんだろう……。\nあれ、雪歩？　あ、この匂いはもしかして……。", "zh": "嗅嗅，是什么味道呢……  \n咦，雪步？啊，这个味道难道是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0392_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0392_1002_004yuk", "source_sha256": "50e50407a8cc144f9bd610e944029983a6b69ba80e10dec256c52bb1200877c9", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}。はい。\n実はさっきまで、みんなとお料理をしていて……。", "zh": "啊，{$P$}。嗯。\n其实刚才一直在和大家一起做料理……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0392_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0392_1003_p", "source_sha256": "2a2ff6358e862f0cc2b6a10cc847c5b52b964ef8c63484e3c5cd63b3420a2d25", "ja": "なるほど、いい匂いがすると思ったよ。\n作っていたのは……チョコレートかな？", "zh": "原来如此，难怪我觉得有股香味。\n你们刚才做的是……巧克力吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0392_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0392_1004_004yuk", "source_sha256": "71f408bee0fb613febd30553415fa95a49759a7747c1f354fb57bef3786f7e60", "ja": "はい。おいしいお菓子のレシピを見つけたので、\nみんなにも教えてあげたいと思って……♪", "zh": "是的。我找到了美味点心的食谱，所以也想教给大家……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0392_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0392_1005_004yuk", "source_sha256": "161b739b0429f54d504b88265e5daa33c96e467cb4d18a4347f4a4494e423d5e", "ja": "抹茶パウダーを使うのがコツなんです。\nお茶の風味とチョコの甘さが、すごく合うんですよ。", "zh": "诀窍是要用抹茶粉。\n茶香和巧克力的甜味特别相配呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0392_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0392_1006_p", "source_sha256": "94c156b4819c29446e019966539220ae77a916a95f571b869ab6bafe5a3275ce", "ja": "へぇ、お茶にこだわる雪歩が勧めるってことは、\nそれは本当においしいんだろうな。", "zh": "哦，坚持讲究茶叶的雪步推荐的东西，肯定真的很好吃吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0392_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0392_1007_004yuk", "source_sha256": "23005cd7b1925d6056d52747d6327624406cd9c758ebf39311ac8b814f68b8c3", "ja": "えへへ……。よかったら{$P$}も、\nおひとつ、いかがですか？", "zh": "嘿嘿……如果您愿意的话，{$P$}先生也来一杯怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0392_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0392_1008_p", "source_sha256": "04bc81e1c9eac2c4a9d5f83d6a2d0c5998074c14e9c3d5828d830d4e6c40e41d", "ja": "いいのか？\n実はちょうど休憩を入れようと思ってたんだよ。", "zh": "可以吗？\n其实我正想着差不多该休息一下呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0392_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0392_1009_004yuk", "source_sha256": "2d3aa5b345198764d81c9ec98c98528b3821de3bf8e8ca8df20364c15b2c6e12", "ja": "もちろんですぅ！　おいしくできたから、\n{$P$}にも食べて欲しいです♪", "zh": "当然可以呀！做得很好吃，所以也想让{$P$}也尝尝♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
